    "created_at": "2016-11-18T11:09:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-18T11:09:26Z",
    "body": "The current bit about DOCTYPEs already affects all of XML. `template` element processing affects all of XML. `script` element processing affects all of XML. HTML defines how XML is loaded in browsing contexts too. There's a ton of things HTML defines about XML already and nobody has objected about that thus far.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
