    "updated_at": "2016-11-18T11:41:01Z",
    "body": "> Anyway I’m not personally opposed to making the spec say the entities should work in UAs for any XML. So I’ll take a shot at refining the patch here to actually say that.\n\nThe section the requirement is currently in is the [“The XHTML syntax” section](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html)—specifically about XHTML and not about XML in general. So I am looking right now for where else in the spec to move it to. In the mean time, guidance welcome.\n",
